      </figure>

      {#
        The award. voice-tone.md bans "award-winning" unless it is verified
        with a specific award name and year. This one is: Vegan in San Diego,
        Best of 2017, Runner-Up for Vegan Ramen, published 2018
        (CLIENT_FACTS.md press list). Stated as the record, not as a boast, and
        the year is on the face of it because the year is the point.
      #}
      <article class="cell diff__cell diff__cell--wide reveal">
        <h3 class="diff__title">Runner-Up, <em>Best of 2017.</em></h3>
        <p class="diff__body">
          Vegan in San Diego named this bowl a Runner-Up for Best Vegan Ramen in its Best of 2017. That was eight years ago. The vegan bowl has been on this menu a long time, and it was here well before the Noodle Room was.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

